  <h1>What does an architect actually do?</h1>
  <p class="lead muted">Less sketching on rooftops, more coordinating a project from a napkin idea to a finished building. Here is what the job really involves - and where students often get the wrong picture.</p>

  <figure class="fig"><div class="fig-body">
